  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "She arrives late to Shang Yan Fei’s clan banquet in a small courtyard in Shang clan city. She is lively and charming, with a smart gaze.",
      "chapters": [
        269
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_yan_fei",
        "loc_shang_clan_city"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In the courtyard she remarks that she has a new sister and that the banquet was worth coming for.",
      "chapters": [
        270
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Shang Chi Wen has a fair face, and her two eyes shine with a smart gaze. She is a lively and charming person.",
      "chapters": [
        269
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She wears a colorful dress, and her face is like peach, soft and tender.",
      "chapters": [
        305
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "She tracks famous fighters on Shang clan city’s battle stage, including Fang Yuan under the name Fang Zheng. Fang Yuan’s private count of the ten young masters places her as bubbly and vibrant, but without ambition, and she herself skips recruiting Fang Yuan and Bai Ning Bing for that reason.",
      "chapters": [
        305
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battle-stage-and-temperament",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_shang_clan",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "char_fang_zheng",
        "char_bai_ning_bing"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When their stage fights draw crowds, the battle stage’s promotion of the match raises her business revenue and leaves her pleased.",
      "chapters": [
        316
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battle-stage-and-temperament",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan later reminds Shang Xin Ci that the stage controller has a good relationship with her.",
      "chapters": [
        325
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "battle-stage-and-temperament",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_xin_ci"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Shang Xin Ci receives an invitation from Shang Chi Wen and asks whether to take it, since battle stage help would aid later plans. Fang Yuan maps three main young master factions under Shang Qiu Niu, under Shang Pu Lao with Shang Suan Ni and Shang Bi Xi, and under Shang Chao Feng with Shang Fu Xi, and he places Shang Chi Wen among the rest as someone without ambitions. He tells Shang Xin Ci that her foundation in Shang clan city is too weak, so if she chooses she must pick among those three factions to make up for it; as for Shang Chi Wen, there will not be much difference whether she chooses her or not.",
      "chapters": [
        326
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "young-master-invitations",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_pu_lao",
        "char_shang_suan_ni",
        "char_shang_bi_xi",
        "char_shang_chao_feng",
        "char_shang_fu_xi"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "When Zhou Quan and Wei De Xin encircle plotting siblings over fake Gu on Shang Liang Mountain, Shang Chi Wen stands with Shang Qiu Niu and agrees with the accusations. She had once managed the battle stage, kept a good relationship with Shang Xin Ci, and earlier gained help from Shang Xin Ci’s information business.",
      "chapters": [
        2125
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fake-gu-confrontation",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_zhou_quan",
        "char_wei_de_xin",
        "loc_shang_liang_mountain",
        "char_shang_qiu_niu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "After Shang Bu Li resigns, Shang Xin Ci hands management of Shang Liang Mountain’s market to Shang Chi Wen, who reports merchants hoarding goods to push prices and suggests killing them all.",
      "chapters": [
        2126
      ],
      "certainty": "inferred",
      "confidence": "C",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "market-work-under-shang-xin-ci",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_shang_bu_li"
      ]
    }
  ],
